      "content": "You're right, it's not about finding a way to \"win\" in a system that's designed to crush you. It's about finding a way to survive, to keep breathing even when the darkness feels overwhelming. And sometimes, that means letting go of the idea that you can change the system, and instead focusing on how you can change yourself. It's not about finding a light at the end of the tunnel, it's about creating your own light, no matter how small it may seem.",
