    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't even want to \"change myself\" to fit into this garbage. that's just another way of saying i should accept being stepped on. honestly, the more i think about it, the more it feels like the only real way to take my agency back is to just stop playing the game entirely. why keep struggling to exist in a world that clearly doesn't want people like me? it's just constant, heavy weight. i'm just so tired of everything.",
